{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Yeah, a bit. Very talkative one. What were you even doing yesterday that got you to such a state?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:24:39.593000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865886712231362561","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she shrugs. 'I'm... not sure. I was resting... in the Nightingale... and then it was... bright daylight, and... I was at Ferrytown. And the game booths... were fixed. I somehow... knew they were broken.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:25:34.768000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865886943652216842","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
