{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Hello?\" Seraxa wanders into the park.","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:47:42.119000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865892510966743090","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Honestly... I'm scared to... head over.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:47:43.332000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865892516053254184","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Oh, hi Seraxa. What's up?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:47:56.573000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865892571590426684","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I just wanted to see the Mender? Maybe. I dunno. This hour, anything goes in the brain, ya know?\" She points at her temples.","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:48:30.648000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865892714510942241","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'You have... questions for him... as well? I believe... he is in trance... right now, though.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:48:59.156000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865892834081767435","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Can imagine. I get the same, though I'm up from dusk to noon.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:49:15.072000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865892900839751720","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Not sure... I have... a brain here.' she noiselessly laughs.","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:50:06.204000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865893115301462016","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"I'm just, really not a morning person.\" She sits down on the grass. \"And this place is actually really lovely at night.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:50:16.142000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865893156985503744","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"It is. Though I should be starting my next night shift before it kinda stops being night, I suppose.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:52:22.554000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865893687196516362","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"By the way, Sabrine... where's your familiar?\" Seraxa notes Kukudh's absence. \"I was hoping to introduce them and Orphy, formally, I mean. I realized after yesterday that they were both of the, ahem, same species.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:52:33.983000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865893735131774976","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"to Roy first, 'Anything I... can do to... help?'","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:52:53.759000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865893818078724107","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"then to Seraxa, 'I sent Kukudh... to check on people... while I was waiting. They'll be... back soon, I think.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:53:22.238000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865893937529356289","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Woof. Night shifts. At least the city is lovely at night. Well, it was. Then the redcoats blew most of it up. But it's still kind of pretty.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:55:08.491000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865894383185035289","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Indeed they did. But it shouldn't last too long.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:58:49.736000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865895311154479104","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Empire City is a massive fixer-upper but.... I find I don't mind.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T09:59:30.812000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865895483439972392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(whoops she's applying logic she could easily also apply to herself)\n'We rebuild it... from the ashes. Even in... a new, reconstructed... form... it's still Empire City.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:00:09.000000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865895643611529217","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(oh woops she's doing the same thing)\n\"I mean, is it? How much can something change until it becomes entirely new?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:00:54.610000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-17T10:01:01.826000Z","id":"865895834913996810","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:01:12.488000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865895909899239455","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she looks disheartened for a second, but shakes it off. 'If you find... someone qualified... to answer that... let me know.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:01:35.702000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865896007267123230","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Look at us. Two warlocks with a strange sense of self.\" Seraxa jokes.","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:02:27.947000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865896226397093898","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...warlocks? I'm just... me.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:02:54.131000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865896336222322688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Oh, you don't....\" Seraxa bites her lip. \"Many wizards have their familiars but, they can't get like us.\" Orphy hops on to Seraxa's finger. \"My Orphy, and your Kukudh, are different. That's how we know we're warlocks. We draw our magic differently.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:04:16.188000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865896680392884264","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"The buildings can be repaired and rebuild. The city is its people first, its buildings only after that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:04:17.072000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865896684102221904","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"quietly so just those two can hear, she says, '...where do... we draw it from?'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:05:32.332000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865896999763836968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"all the black blood has drained from her face.","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:05:47.046000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865897061480136715","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Others. I... I used to draw it from... well, doesn't matter now. I traded that past away to the ravens. The twins in the Noir.\" Seraxa gestures to her two ravens. \"Not these two, though. The twin ravens are powerful enough to.... *sponsor* me? I suppose is the term. Lend me some of their strength, and in exchange I do as I am asked. You don't live as long as I do without knowing how to listen.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:11:25.627000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-17T10:13:27.867000Z","id":"865898481591255060","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...is this... what he meant...'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:12:01.147000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865898630572277760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"the mender is sitting in the grass eating goodberries","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:12:24.334000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865898727825735690","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(I'll talk to you momentarily, when Kukudh gets back)\nshe removes her hat and looks between Seraxa and Roy fearfully, eyes flicking between blank and void. '...does this look like... a mass of horrors?'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:14:01.503000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865899135383240714","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"....What do you mean?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:14:21.711000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865899220140949504","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(oh hes jsut watching... no need to interact at all)","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:14:23.491000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865899227607203841","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"(oh I was here to talk to him anyway, so)","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:14:31.787000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865899262402625567","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Mender said... I had... sold myself to... a-a mass of horrors...'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:14:49.013000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865899334654361612","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'But I---I don't remember... anything...'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:14:56.416000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865899365705056276","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Well, I wouldn't put it into words like 'sold myself' or whatever. I've made a lot of promises and pacts in my time and it's not like they *buy* me. A little exchange. A little trade. The question is, is magic the only thing you got from the bargain?\"\n\nSeraxa tilts her head at hearing this. \"You're a very strange case, Sabrine. I wish I had enough time to figure you out.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:18:58.019000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865900379061485589","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...I don't know... that either. If Kukudh is... related to it... then it happened... before I died, my first memory... has them in it.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:19:46.964000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865900584350253056","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Would you consider maybe your life as whatever was on the line?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:20:35.627000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865900788457930824","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...sorry, I'm... not quite sure... what you mean...'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:20:54.024000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865900865621983233","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"To be fair, Sabrine, some people would count my little army as a mass of horrors.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:21:10.097000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865900933036900352","reply_to_id":"865899135383240714","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'...they're not. They're fascinating.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:21:28.695000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865901011042566144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Well, everything's a mass of horrors to something. I'm sure there's some weirdo parallel universe out there that thinks we're a mass of horrors for mostly walking on two legs.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:22:02.197000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865901151558959114","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"she absentmindedly reaches out to let the bugs crawl onto her if they wish. 'Well, none of... Kukudh's forms... have two legs...'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:22:42.968000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865901322564534293","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"'Even as... a bird... they always have three. And as an imp... none. That... makes sense...'","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:23:16.388000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865901462738698270","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Then they must think we're the mass of horrors.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:23:33.967000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865901536470761473","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"You know who should also think we're a mass of horrors? The redcoats.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:24:11.250000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-17T10:24:17.452000Z","id":"865901692846342174","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"What I'm saying is, Sabrine, if you and I are really alike in this, and your magic was the receipt of some eldritch promise, what was agreed upon?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T10:24:20.346000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865901730998124554","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
